# 🛠️ 使用工具

本流程主要整合以下工具：

| 工具                         | 用途                          |
| -------------------------- | --------------------------- |
| **RFdiffusionAA**          | 蛋白質 backbone generation     |
| **LigandMPNN**             | Protein sequence design     |
| **RCSB Protein Data Bank** | Protein structure database  |
| **AlphaFold2 / ColabFold** | Structure prediction        |
| **Google Colab**           | Cloud execution environment |

---

# 📂 專案流程

```text
                Existing Structure
                       │
                       ▼
                Structure Parsing
                       │
                       ▼
                 RFdiffusionAA
                       │
                       ▼
                 Backbone Design
                       │
                       ▼
                  LigandMPNN
                       │
                       ▼
                 Sequence Design
                       │
                       ▼
              Structure Validation
                       │
                       ▼
               Candidate Filtering
```

