# 📁 Colab Workflow

```text
📓 Colab 1
Automated Motif Scaffolding
        │
        ├── PDB Fetching
        ├── RFdiffusionAA
        └── LigandMPNN
                 │
                 ▼

📓 Colab 2
De Novo Ligand Binder Design
        │
        ├── PDB Parsing
        ├── Ligand Extraction
        ├── RFdiffusionAA
        └── LigandMPNN
                 │
                 ▼

📓 Colab 3
Structure Validation
        │
        ├── Structure Prediction
        ├── Structural Analysis
        └── Candidate Filtering
```

